<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\たたら場.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜山頂.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\元木市遠景.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>In the end, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE> didn't answer all my questions.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>, whose heart should have been ripped out―<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Good morning, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">...! How...!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, do you want to go back to prison again?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Wh-what are you saying...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"You don't want to be apart from me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> anymore, right?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, if you go back to prison, you'll never get out till you die, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Then why not just... be with us..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I don't want to be apart from you anymore, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, you've suffered enough, so... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">no more..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Of course I don't want to go back to prison.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But if <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu</STYLE> are all dead, there's nowhere left for me to end up.<PG>
That's right. The people dear to me are all dead.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if I'm sent back to the outside world now, I have nowhere to go.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But―<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"B... but! </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is going to expose the truth of the Megasawa City case...! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　And then I...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that, my two daughters looked sad.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Because... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">you understand by now, right? We can't leave here anymore."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm sorry, but we divine messengers can't leave the Goddess's territory. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If you ran away from here, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, we'd never again..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"No..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Besides, even for </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, standing up to the state is way too reckless."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That's right. Sure, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> smart. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　But there's no way she can expose the truth of the Megasawa City case. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">And even if she did expose it, she couldn't get you released, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah... A rigged trial gets reported, it sways public opinion, and that only gets you to the starting line."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, it's the kind of case that forced a life sentence on you, isn't it? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　There'd be a press embargo, and it wouldn't even reach society. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I bet </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> would get frozen out by all kinds of industries too, and she wouldn't be able to make a living."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you'd end up losing not just us, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Us, fine, but for </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> that's just too cruel..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> would be as good as dead in this society... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">So, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, as long as you have us, you'll be fine. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">There's nothing to be lonely about anymore."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, we'll be here, forever and ever."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Besides, there's a simpler way. </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, a way for you to be released from your life sentence."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah, we haven't told you that one yet. That way we won't be causing </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> any trouble either."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Really...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, all you have to do is wish to be with us."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"With just that, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you'll never have to go back to prison. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">You'll be with us, forever."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Just wish...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, I'm wishing to be with you too, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"You know... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'm your real daughter, and you've never once held me, right?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　I want you to hold me, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Hold me for all the years you held back, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE><PG>
I have nowhere to go.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Staying here in Motoki City won't change anything.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can't be a burden to <STYLE ID="5">Goto-chan</STYLE> either.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then... 
{PAUSE ""}
I might as well...<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"All I have to do is wish...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, and then we're together forever."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm happy. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Hurry, come to us."</STYLE><PG>
How could I not wish for it?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My family, kept apart all this time―and the identity I could never reveal.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now that every one of those barriers is gone, what I've always wished for in my heart can come true.<PG>
Above all―
{PAUSE ""}
I'm just... 
{PAUSE ""}
tired.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Bearing the guilt of a violent criminal all this time, serving a sentence with no end in sight.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And now, thrown out into this ruined city.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm just so tired.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's...
{PAUSE ""}
all right now, isn't it?<PG>
I―
{PAUSE ""}
with my daughters―
{PAUSE ""}
with <STYLE ID="4">my best friend</STYLE>―
{PAUSE ""}
want to live in peace together, forever―
{PAUSE ""}
That is my wish.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n798\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\菌糸.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Something is entering me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Something enters my body, and―<PG>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Open your eyes, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's <STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan's</STYLE> voice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I want to greet her, but no voice comes out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But that heavy, oppressive air feels wonderfully refreshing.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Let's </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="かえ">return</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> together."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Return?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So I'm returning.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I understand my fate.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I am returning.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With <STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE>, and <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>, and <STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu</STYLE>.<PG>
I am connected to <STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I am connected to <STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu</STYLE> is here too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can sense it.<PG>
I see... I see now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE> was looking out for us, even like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She gave us eternal time, so that we'd suffer as little as possible.<PG>
Thanks to this air that turns away intruders from the outside world, we are promised eternal rest.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ah...
{PAUSE ""}
but I have just one regret.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜山頂.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンション外観.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, can you hear me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... I left her behind all by herself..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ahh... that's sad for her..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> owes her so much, so </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Got it. I'll go to </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンションエントランス.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"But </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> doesn't qualify to be a divine messenger. What should I do..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"But it's too sad for her to wait there for us to come back and die all alone."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah. Now that she knows this much, we can't let her out alive either. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Can't be helped. We'll have </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> return to the earth and become our nourishment."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンションドア.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
I'm glad.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンション玄関.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Now <STYLE ID="5">Goto-chan</STYLE> won't have to feel lonely, and she won't die all alone in that building.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンションリビング.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
I'm glad.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "$0000FF" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I'm truly glad.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜吹雪風船なし.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "600" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "$FFFFFF" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n100\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The cherry tree has used my body to bring me a new life.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I was sentenced to life imprisonment, this is what I thought.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From this moment, a new step in my life begins.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Despair, or hope―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That goes without saying.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No one could possibly call it hope.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm no exception.<PG>
But now it's different.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From this moment, a new step in my life begins.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Despair, or hope―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That goes without saying.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No one could possibly call it despair.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm no exception.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\中央公園\御神木足跡なし.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
With this parasitic cherry, a prison of hope is complete.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Yes, if I remember right, this cherry's name.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's not goshinboku, and it's not the Arata cherry.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Those are names that people of recent times gave it, to make it easy to call.<PG>
She had―
{PAUSE ""}
the Goddess had quite another name.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I remember right...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,111" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\テレビの声.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">―The government's regular press conference has just begun.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">We bring it to you live.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\ラジオ血1.lcm" "REPEAT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"At present, there has been no contact from the special unit sent to investigate Motoki City. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">We are still awaiting the results of the special unit's investigation, but the survival of Motoki City's residents is, as feared, regarded as hopeless. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Accordingly, effective immediately, a 100 km radius from central Motoki City is designated a permanent no-entry zone, and―"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">―Chief Cabinet Secretary! Is that due to the toxic gas after all!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">―There are also reports of an accident involving radioactive material!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">―Is there no chance this is a military attack from overseas!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">―Isn't 150,000 dead in a natural disaster the result of disaster preparedness that was far too sloppy!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">―Many voices at home and abroad are questioning the government's response this time!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">―Is the special unit really safe!?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Well... we ourselves do not yet have accurate information either, so at this stage everything is under investigation. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">However, there is at present no danger of the toxic gas spreading into other areas, so please rest assured―"</STYLE><PG>
